{"id":1,"name":"EV001","note":"","pages":[{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":false,"switch1Id":7,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"tileId":0,"characterName":"Actor2","direction":2,"pattern":2,"characterIndex":4},"list":[{"code":111,"indent":0,"parameters":[4,5,0]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["Actor2",6,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\n<Archmage Tesiras>Ah, the chosen one sent to aid us. Welcome to the tower. We have been expecting you."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["mage_portrait",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["It is a great honor to aid my brothers and sisters in True Art and defeat the great evil that looms over all of Arkhos."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["Actor2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\n<Archmage Anamoria>Azrog-Khaan is no mere foe; he twists the essence of magic itself into something vile and unnatural. His defeat is essential for the balance of all arcane energies."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["Actor2",6,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\n<Archmage Tesiras>Before you join us in the greater battle, we require your help with a pressing matter. The ritual to contain his influence requires a rare reagent: the Everbloom Shard. It lies in the depths of the sewers beneath this city."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["Actor2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\n<Archmage Anamoria>Be cautious. The creature known as the Toadaphan guards these depths jealously. It is a foe of both cunning and strength. Bring back the shard, and we shall prepare the ritual."]},{"code":121,"indent":1,"parameters":[7,7,0]},{"code":356,"indent":1,"parameters":["Quest Journal Open To 6"]},{"code":123,"indent":1,"parameters":["A",0]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":411,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["Actor2",4,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\n<Archmage>Seems you have a topographical disorder if you ended here. Please, leave."]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":412,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":true},{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":true,"switch1Id":1,"switch1Valid":true,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"tileId":0,"characterName":"Actor2","direction":2,"pattern":1,"characterIndex":4},"list":[{"code":111,"indent":0,"parameters":[4,5,0]},{"code":102,"indent":1,"parameters":[["Excuse my arrogance, but Everbloom Shard, what is that?","What more must I know ere I depart?","I shall not falter. The shard shall be thine."],-1,-1,2,0]},{"code":402,"indent":1,"parameters":[0,"Excuse my arrogance, but Everbloom Shard, what is that?"]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"parameters":["Actor2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["\\n<Archmage Anamoria>Oh, just one rare but rather useful flower. Despite it’s name, such beauty grows only in most hideous places, like sewers. Such an irony."]},{"code":0,"indent":2,"parameters":[]},{"code":402,"indent":1,"parameters":[1,"What more must I know ere I depart?"]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"parameters":["Actor2",6,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["\\n<Archmage Tesiras>Carry with thee a charged crystal, for it shall reveal the shard’s glow. If thou encounter signs of Azrog-Khaan’s corruption, return forthwith. Do not tarry"]},{"code":121,"indent":2,"parameters":[12,12,0]},{"code":356,"indent":2,"parameters":["Quest 6 add objective 1"]},{"code":0,"indent":2,"parameters":[]},{"code":402,"indent":1,"parameters":[2,"I shall not falter. The shard shall be thine."]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"parameters":["Actor2",6,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["\\n<Archmage Tesiras>Spoken as one of true resolve. May the weave of the arcane guide thy steps"]},{"code":0,"indent":2,"parameters":[]},{"code":404,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":123,"indent":1,"parameters":["B",0]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":411,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":412,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":true},{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":13,"itemValid":true,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":false,"switch1Id":1,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"tileId":0,"characterName":"Actor2","direction":2,"pattern":1,"characterIndex":4},"list":[{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Actor2",6,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Archmage Tesiras> How peculiar. You are much wiser than we thought if you managed to find this rare herb."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Actor2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Archmage Anamoria> Or lucky. Anyway, this proves that you are worthy to become part in our great plan on defeating Azrog-Khaan."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Actor2",4,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Archmage Elsur>I see that you are worthy of our expenses. If you require anything, feel free to go to Master Makinto’s tower. He will give you a great discount. But first, a ritual."]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":true}],"x":4,"y":2},
